# 管理情報 (design 11.3), for tools/ui_run.py: the window opened from the menu
# of a link in the first window (実身操作 > 管理情報), a window of the
# desktop's like the others. Its menu of the second button opens with the
# item chosen last on the pointer's row, the rows 20 pixels apart: 閉じる,
# line, 編集 (コピー, 貼り付け), ウインドウ, 小物, 実行. On 付箋指定 a 機能付箋
# is chosen and copied to the tray with 編集 > コピー; the window is carried
# by its band, made larger by its corner, and closed with 閉じる of its menu.
# The first click waits for the first window to be drawn: it is to land on a link.
wait 1000
click 110 100
click 110 100 1
wait 500
move 140 240
wait 150
move 230 240
wait 150
move 230 321
wait 150
click 230 321
expect info: opened TADjsについての管理情報
win TADjsについての管理情報
shot info_window
# 付箋指定, its first 機能付箋 chosen
click 262 93
wait 200
click 200 168
wait 200
shot info_apps
# the menu: 編集 two rows below 閉じる, its list to the right, コピー level with it
click 300 300 1
expect desktop: menu TADjsについての管理情報
wait 300
shot info_menu
move 310 340
wait 150
move 330 340
wait 150
move 380 340
wait 300
move 420 340
wait 150
shot info_menu_edit
click 420 340
expect desktop: chosen info.copy
wait 300
# carried by its band and made larger by its corner
drag 200 52 300 152
wait 300
win TADjsについての管理情報
drag 633 611 700 680
wait 300
win TADjsについての管理情報
shot info_moved
# 閉じる: 編集 under the pointer, 閉じる two rows above
click 400 400 1
expect desktop: menu
wait 300
click 408 360
expect desktop: chosen close
expect info: closed
wins
# nothing it did was refused for want of a right
absent !OACV!
